#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"```markdown\n"
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Yon senp aplikasyon TypeScript (atravè Vite) stile avèk\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"e ki itilize eleman custom endepandan soti nan\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Devlopman\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Sa ki gen la\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` enpòte `@pantoken/css` (defini chak propriyete custom `--"
"instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (klasè `.instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (konnekte modal, tooltip, ak lòt konpòtman "
"konpozan dèfò), ak\n"
"  `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-rejistre eleman tankou `<instui-icon>`), "
"apre sa\n"
"  rann makip nan `#app`.\n"
"- Pwen enjesyon opsyonel (header, filtè, kontni, trayèn) yo make avèk\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — ranplase kontni yo avèk makip pa ou.\n"
"- Itilize eleman custom dirèkteman nan makip, egzanp `<instui-button>`, "
"`<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  wè [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  pou lis konplè eleman yo.\n"
"\n"
"## Aprann plis\n"
"\n"
"Wè [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) a pou aprann plis.\n"
"```\n"
